WEBVTT

00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:03.120
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I<b>’ve got</b> a brother and two sisters.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.021
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I <b>haven’t got</b> any pets.

00:00:08.897 --> 00:00:11.029
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She<b>’s got</b> a beautiful house.

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:15.063
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>hasn’t got</b> many friends.

00:00:17.091 --> 00:00:18.777
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Have</b> they <b>got</b> any children?

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.988
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> No, they <b>haven’t</b>.

00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:25.112
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>Has</b> the hotel <b>got</b> a swimming pool?

00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:27.560
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Yes, it <b>has</b>.